    "estimand": "Average treatment effect of a preceding teammate DRIVE on the PPP of the immediately following team PNR possession, relative to all other PNR possessions, controlling for confounders.",
    "unit": "A team possession classified as PNR.",
    "sample": "All NBA regular-season and playoff possessions from 2022-23 through 2025-26 where the offense runs a PNR and the preceding possession by the same team is identifiable. Exclude possessions with timeouts, free-throw sequences, or end-of-quarter gaps between, and exclude garbage-time (score diff >20 in Q4).",
