    "controls": "Fixed effects for player (PNR initiator), opposing team defense, quarter, score differential (binned), rest days, and indicator for home/away. Cluster standard errors at the team-game level.",
    "falsification": "Test (a) whether the effect disappears when using a pseudo-preceding possession (a randomly chosen prior possession of the same team), (b) whether the effect is present when the DRIVE is replaced by any other play type not believed to have a causal link, (c) whether the effect is reversed when testing preceding DRIVE on non-PNR possessions.",
    "multiplicity": "Single hypothesis test (aggregate all teammate DRIVE->PNR sequences). If exploratory disaggregation by player or team, apply Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction.",
    "decision_rule": "Two-tailed t-test of the coefficient on the indicator variable 'preceded_by_teammate_DRIVE' in the controlled regression, with alpha=0.05. Reject null of zero effect if |t| > 1.96. Infer 'raises' only if coefficient positive and significant, but recommend two-tailed given prior evidence of mixed signs.",
    "data_version": "NBA stats API play-by-play derived possession records, 2022-23 through 2025-26, as of 2026-06-14, with play-type labels from the project's graph database (DRIVE, PNR)."
  }
}}

